--- !u!114 &371642819
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 371642818}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9b7177a6ae0a85e4d95b3c489927c19b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  slideImage: {fileID: 1839138143}
  slideText: {fileID: 493864239}
  skipButton: {fileID: 1866061480}
  fadeGroup: {fileID: 1308102826}
  audioSource: {fileID: 488731589}
  blackBackground: {fileID: 1801845648}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 67ccaceea6b3200469da80e1cbb95d95, type: 3}
    text: No one knows how it happened. A solar flare, a chunk of glowing space rock,
      a science experiment that went... right? Whatever it was, the world didn't
      end. It just got a whole lot hairier.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5fdb8b3d9daef54ab74c0449d3dd5cc, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 8894198aaff30cf4093453110acab722, type: 3}
    text: The Apes got smart. Scary smart. In a few short centuries, they built a
      new world on top of our old one. They took our cities, our jobs, and our spot
      at the top of the food chain.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3f50238f896a2246b1c20d5bd624659, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 18bac1f85dd534f428718a4076a982e1, type: 3}
    text: And humanity? They call us 'the Primitives.' 'Mischievous monkeys.' We
      live in the cracks, the forgotten tunnels, surviving on their scraps. They
      see us as a nuisance. A joke.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d10b3a8e7596e2c4bbf1a977ec8e0747, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bbed0121bcd08754b9b79b180eb440f1, type: 3}
    text: 'In their new world, gold is just a shiny rock. Their entire economy is
      built on one thing: Bananas. The Potassium Standard. The bigger and yellower,
      the better.'
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9f0abd4527bec0488f1a7d6d1080c56, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b31b98b30131d3045b26f18f7e5654c7, type: 3}
    text: And deep within the most secure vault on the planet lies their crown jewel.
      The symbol of their power, their wealth, their dominance... the legendary Golden
      Banana.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4207d7a4e87532c4cb5db1c1f95e0b1c, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ff349e39e3e491c42baffe9486e28edb, type: 3}
    text: They think we're a joke? Fine. It's time for a punchline they'll never
      forget. They see us as bandits? Then we'll give them the heist of a lifetime.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3db5a9a86fb0fd04aa0075afb44b3a5d, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 534ea3f221e393c4bb9596c99ef07ada, type: 3}
    text: We're going to hit them where they live. We're going to peel back their
      security, bypass their guards, and take the one thing they hold sacred. We're
      going to show them that human ingenuity isn't extinct.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d9548d0fc075b9419320e2fbec1474a, type: 3}
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c614f070138ca8649b4a398a4ffa9c90, type: 3}
    text: We are the Banana Bandits. And this is the Great Banana Bank Heist.
    narration: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e623d7124618a3a419493a33f36b1d4f, type: 3}
  fadeDuration: 0.3
  blackScreenDuration: 0.3
  typeSpeed: 0.075
  audioFadeDuration: 0.5
